## 4. Memory Stress Test

Automated procedure (Vitest + disposal tracking):

```
1. Mount viewport-3d module
2. Load FDM domain with 100k cells + field
3. Record baseline: geometry count, material count, texture count
4. Switch quantity 5 times
   → Assert: no geometry growth (field updates only)
5. Switch layout: single → quad → single
   → Assert: canvases created/destroyed cleanly, geometry count bounded
6. Switch to viewport-2d module (unmount 3D)
   → Assert: all 3D resources released (R3F auto-dispose)
7. Switch back to viewport-3d
   → Assert: resources recreated at baseline level
8. Repeat steps 4-7 three times
   → Assert: no cumulative growth
9. Unmount viewport-3d
   → Assert: zero residual resources
```

## 5. Idle Performance Audit

```
1. Mount viewport with data loaded
2. Wait for initial settling (all layers rendered)
3. Start frame counter (spy on renderer.render)
4. Wait 5 seconds, no interaction
5. Assert frame count === 0
6. Assert no requestAnimationFrame pending
7. Assert no active setTimeout/setInterval
8. Assert no pending fetch requests
```

This validates R3F `frameloop="demand"` is working correctly.

## 6. Context Loss Recovery Test

```
1. Mount viewport, render initial frame
2. Dispatch webglcontextlost event on canvas
3. Assert no render errors
4. Dispatch webglcontextrestored event
5. Assert scene is intact (objects visible, correct quantity)
6. Assert no resource leaks from the lost context
```

R3F handles this internally, but we test to catch regressions.

## 7. Large Simulation Performance Test

```
1. Create mock FDM domain: 500×500×4 = 1M cells
2. Mount viewport, measure time to first frame
   → Budget: < 200ms
3. Switch quantity
   → Budget: < 50ms (no geometry rebuild)
4. Measure glyph subsampling time for 1M → 10k glyphs
   → Budget: < 20ms
5. Measure camera interaction frame time with 1M cells
   → Budget: < 16ms (60fps)
```

## 8. Performance Budgets

| Metric | Budget |
|---|---|
| First frame (100k cells) | < 100ms |
| First frame (1M cells) | < 200ms |
| Quantity switch (color update) | < 50ms |
| Topology rebuild (new mesh) | < 300ms for 1M cells |
| Camera frame (interactive) | < 16ms |
| Glyph subsampling (1M → 10k) | < 20ms |
| Idle frame count (per minute) | 0 |
| Memory per quantity switch | < 1MB net |
| Memory per layout switch | 0 net (after GC) |
| Memory per 3D↔2D switch | 0 net (after GC) |

